    {
      "page_title": "NTILE Limits and True Medians",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. Summary",
          "ink": "black"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Bucket sizes differ by at most **one**",
            "Ties can land in different buckets",
            "True median: `PERCENTILE_CONT(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY x)`",
            "NTILE is only bucketing, not statistics"
          ],
          "style": "checkbox"
        }
      ],
      "hero": "postgresql",
      "subtitle": "Value and bucket functions"
    },
    {
      "page_title": "Named WINDOW Clause and Reuse",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. What is a named window?",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`WINDOW w AS (PARTITION BY dept ORDER BY salary DESC)` names a spec",
            "It sits after ==HAVING== and before the final `ORDER BY`",
            "Use it with `OVER w` instead of repeating the spec",
            "Several windows: `WINDOW w1 AS (...), w2 AS (...)`"
          ],
          "style": "star",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. How it works",
          "ink": "purple"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "sql",
          "lines": [
            "SELECT dept, salary,",
            "  RANK() OVER w,",
            "  SUM(salary) OVER w",
            "FROM emp",
            "WINDOW w AS (PARTITION BY dept",
            "  ORDER BY salary DESC);"
          ],
          "note": "one spec, two functions"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "sticky",
          "title": "List order",
          "text": "A window can only build on one defined **earlier** in the WINDOW list."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "3. Extending a window",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "sql",
